// HAYALET-KUNYE-1008 · Elba: EB1911 c.9 s.177-178 «In 1548 it was ceded by them to Cosimo I.» · «In 1802 the island
//   was given to France by the peace of Amiens.» (yıl → 01-01) · Napolyon «from the 5th of May 1814 to the 26th of
//   February 1815» egemen — künye YOK ⇒ __BOSLUK__ BEYANI (1815-06-09'a dek: dönüş günü kaynakta yok) · Toskana'ya
//   iade: Viyana Nihai Senedi 9 Haziran 1815 (GRIPS «World and Japan» metni: «That part of the island of Elba»).
